    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d419">

                <pb facs="0415" n="405" xml:id="pg405"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.796/84: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jenkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-02-24T15:00:00-04:00">February 24, 1941—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Department’s No. 13, February 18, 8 p.m. Memorandum asking whether Bolivian
                    Government would agree in principle to consider plan for reorganization of
                    L.A.B. was presented to Minister for Foreign Affairs<anchor n="6"
                        xml:id="d419-f1"/> on February 20. He expressed personal agreement and said
                    he would take matter up at Cabinet meeting and give me definite reply. He did
                    not mention proposed approach to the Department by the Bolivian Minister in
                        Washington<anchor n="7" xml:id="d419-f2"/> for assistance in reorganization
                    of L.A.B. stated by Minister of Finance<anchor n="8" xml:id="d419-f3"/> to have
                    been decided upon as reported in my despatch 648, February 13.<anchor n="9"
                        xml:id="d419-f4"/> Carnival holidays and departure of Minister of Foreign
                    Affairs from La Paz will probably delay answer for some time. Will report
                    further after return of Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jenkins</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
